                                                "sense_id": "210b0028-b1b5-3067-b92d-a64246d77a65",
                                                "text": "An appointment with a clinician at which the patient or partner(s) can receive testing and care for all STDs and HIV is the preferred management strategy for CT [chlamydia] and GC treatment."
